      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Great suggestion. When using the Stream Camera I often have to oversize my window and crop it because head tracking forces the top half of the screen to be empty space. I end up doing additional rendering and getting lowered performance, and ending up with a lower quality image that's harder to frame.",
