  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-15T13:48:47.727Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would it be possible to add the tracking options for tracking waist and feet? Currently tracking for pictures and film go off the head. This makes it hard for dancers to have the camera track them close, when it's following their head and they need it to follow their waist or feet. I also would like it at waist or feet for photos.",
